  "details": "Apple device and iOS version:\n\nIPhone 14 on Version 17.5.1\n\nInstalled VRC Testflight Version and VRC Build Number\n\n2024.2.3 (333) and VRC Build 1472\n\nDescription of the Issue:\n\nThe \"Logging\" toggle is only available in the Quick Menu unlike on PC where the toggle is in both the Quick Menu and debug section of the Main Menu settings\n\nSteps I took:\n\nOpened the settings page of the Quick Menu, scrolled down to Logging then opened the settings in the main menu settings, under Debug where Logging would be available on PC it wasn't on iOS\n\nWhat do you expect to happen?\n\nThe Logging toggle would be available in both sections like on PC\n\nWhat happens instead?\n\nLogging is only available in the Quick Menu Settings",
